('N4-L-POINT-010-D1', 'N4-L-POINT-010', 1, '旅行の写真をたくさん持っていますね。', '[{"start":3,"end":5,"answer":"しゃしん","accept":["写真","しゃしん"]},{"start":10,"end":13,"answer":"もって","accept":["持って"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-POINT-010-d1.mp3', 'a9b65b0c8e64ed0f3a9d5ba21184109c2d074d26d6dd8a0995c39faff9073c66', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-POINT-010-D2', 'N4-L-POINT-010', 2, '全部ではなくて、祖母が好きそうな十枚だけです。', '[{"start":0,"end":3,"answer":"ぜんぶで","accept":["全部で","ぜんぶで"]},{"start":8,"end":10,"answer":"そぼ","accept":["祖母"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-POINT-010-d2.mp3', '53d43e02582e49d667aeeed221d4bc2515d408c25d54ffa997da3aba636d1270', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-POINT-011-D1', 'N4-L-POINT-011', 1, '最近、日曜日のテニスで会いませんね。', '[{"start":3,"end":6,"answer":"にちようび","accept":["日曜日"]},{"start":7,"end":10,"answer":"テニス","accept":["テニス"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-POINT-011-d1.mp3', 'a4fa83d7196c00e716e9f6b1a1696772851af664325402742305b4be72a057ae', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-POINT-011-D2', 'N4-L-POINT-011', 2, '足を痛くしたと聞いていましたが、まだ走れないんですか。', '[{"start":0,"end":1,"answer":"あし","accept":["足"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-POINT-011-d2.mp3', '04d584111e98d7135c449098aba5cc80a7ba04136906a5baae80be11600e387f', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-POINT-012-D1', 'N4-L-POINT-012', 1, '今日も昼休みに出かけるんですか。', '[{"start":3,"end":6,"answer":"ひるやすみ","accept":["昼休み"]},{"start":7,"end":11,"answer":"でかける","accept":["出かける","でかける","出掛ける"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-POINT-012-d1.mp3', '1e094895e6165c760aa0706cda67d03527f1dfdfcf0c706e0fdd1ddb9be25276', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-POINT-012-D2', 'N4-L-POINT-012', 2, 'お弁当は今も会社で食べています。', '[{"start":0,"end":3,"answer":"おべんとう","accept":["お弁当"]},{"start":9,"end":12,"answer":"たべて","accept":["食べて"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-POINT-012-d2.mp3', '2b1d139852a60d9f6e5d9e22bb4b44d455a501cc01444a127e68b3bfe9af7b1d', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
