('N4-L-TASK-003-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-003', 1, '上のほうは空いていますが、下のほうがいいんですね。', '[{"start":0,"end":1,"answer":"うえ","accept":["上"]},{"start":13,"end":14,"answer":"した","accept":["下"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-003-d1.mp3', '95da3d40ab23254d5e1bb5d41d708e91c813bf8d736800fc6a9ce69bf071fa2f', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-004-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-004', 1, 'では、お金は明日下ろして、今日は市役所へ先に行きます。', '[{"start":16,"end":19,"answer":"しやくしょ","accept":["市役所","しやくしょ"]},{"start":22,"end":26,"answer":"いきます","accept":["行きます"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-004-d1.mp3', '2894fe1d63c8762efa21822186c172e4029538d6627debc543389a242b9639ab', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-005-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-005', 1, 'では、七時半に駅の時計の下へ行きますね。', '[{"start":9,"end":11,"answer":"とけい","accept":["時計","とけい"]},{"start":14,"end":18,"answer":"いきます","accept":["行きます"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-005-d1.mp3', '39eb43c0bef99f60baf856ca36b76d424da2ccc78a80c0e5d99d3ac52b2a1108', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-006-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-006', 1, '二日だけの旅行なので、小さくても大丈夫です。', '[{"start":5,"end":7,"answer":"りょこう","accept":["旅行","りょこう"]},{"start":16,"end":19,"answer":"だいじょうぶ","accept":["大丈夫"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-006-d1.mp3', '9c382eb91b8eca48cc68d5245956173fb74c7db29cc8677dede8c83026061ec4', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-007-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-007', 1, 'わかりました、写真を撮ってから、黒板を消せばいいですね。', '[{"start":7,"end":9,"answer":"しゃしん","accept":["写真","しゃしん"]},{"start":16,"end":18,"answer":"こくばん","accept":["黒板"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-007-d1.mp3', '0b354ad4e8431022f44e9eb3e5b91c5312198ce55576e6cc70373ab57946e6b3', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-008-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-008', 1, 'それなら、かばんにはタオルだけ入れておきます。', '[{"start":5,"end":8,"answer":"かばん","accept":["かばん"]},{"start":10,"end":13,"answer":"タオル","accept":["タオル"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-008-d1.mp3', 'b31bc579a3deb862752a7926779668408234c063af93d33c15ef6f276f719bfb', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-009-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-009', 1, 'わかりました、荷物を運んでいる会社の番号は、この紙にありますね。', '[{"start":7,"end":9,"answer":"にもつ","accept":["荷物","にもつ"]},{"start":18,"end":20,"answer":"ばんごう","accept":["番号"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-009-d1.mp3', '07b6324af3abc5c5843b71d597b6d1c1ec3fb1e35ef62fd0a62f5398f776732e', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-010-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-010', 1, 'では、五れつ目の真ん中を二枚お願いします。', '[{"start":8,"end":11,"answer":"まんなか","accept":["真ん中"]},{"start":14,"end":20,"answer":"おねがいします","accept":["お願いします","おねがいします"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-010-d1.mp3', 'bda447d5e1d8f0d94153f68b6294c5c965281186a72b57237278bd4f2066cde2', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-011-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-011', 1, 'では、花はまだ入れないで、土を混ぜますね。', '[{"start":3,"end":4,"answer":"はな","accept":["花"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-011-d1.mp3', '8c75d31300266b1d3e9768755b50b70cd1e4d79d3f91bf2f2fb579576643337c', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-012-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-012', 1, 'では、八時半の普通電車に乗ります。', '[{"start":12,"end":16,"answer":"のります","accept":["乗ります","のります"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-012-d1.mp3', '099149fe8b05bb86355e0dae8e1965a06eb4c09584b862478fe400d8beb0540a', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-013-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-013', 1, '日曜日は友だちが来られないので、土曜日の四時をお願いします。', '[{"start":16,"end":19,"answer":"どようび","accept":["土曜日"]},{"start":23,"end":29,"answer":"おねがいします","accept":["お願いします","おねがいします"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-013-d1.mp3', '4d8ef638a81fdf7e713e8b4230356d7e0f677ad55c596cd364c79042e62a13d0', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-014-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-014', 1, 'では、今から駅の前へ行って、新しい写真を撮ってきます。', '[{"start":14,"end":17,"answer":"あたらしい","accept":["新しい"]},{"start":17,"end":19,"answer":"しゃしん","accept":["写真","しゃしん"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-014-d1.mp3', '48af173d2e99fa22ce3e5fb112428c752d01122c5d7aa5e296d06953ecea012f', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-015-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-015', 1, 'わかりました、パンを二つだけ買ってきます。', '[{"start":0,"end":6,"answer":"わかりました","accept":["わかりました"]},{"start":10,"end":12,"answer":"ふたつ","accept":["二つ"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-015-d1.mp3', '676be8b77acebe1c4f5d2bf56f63cd9487d305714b23bd09c79a6a9a8a8717c2', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-016-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-016', 1, 'わかりました、はいいろのシャツと黒いズボンを出しておきます。', '[{"start":12,"end":15,"answer":"シャツ","accept":["シャツ"]},{"start":18,"end":21,"answer":"ズボン","accept":["ズボン"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-016-d1.mp3', 'fb805f6c66e03a3971962d01be68c1704b87997b83ded78a7db031c432a071de', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-017-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-017', 1, 'はい、音を立てないように、玄関から始めます。', '[{"start":13,"end":15,"answer":"げんかん","accept":["玄関","げんかん"]},{"start":17,"end":21,"answer":"はじめます","accept":["始めます"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-017-d1.mp3', '68e272eba8a2b744640a1d4943aafc503b0bc03a20053b0ce702cac61e9a7efc', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-018-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-018', 1, 'では、閉まっているドアの前の箱に入れて帰ります。', '[{"start":12,"end":13,"answer":"まえ","accept":["前","まえ"]},{"start":19,"end":23,"answer":"かえります","accept":["帰ります"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-018-d1.mp3', '7839c6fddcfcf6f088bec7e33cc8e2b12590335b23907d731610ac5c5ff40280', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-019-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-019', 1, '荷物は少ないので、前のかごで十分です。', '[{"start":0,"end":2,"answer":"にもつ","accept":["荷物","にもつ"]},{"start":3,"end":6,"answer":"すくない","accept":["少ない","すくない"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-019-d1.mp3', '3be3d3026f82aa815ecc6fce08b3247568b5db5c19b9df9aa502bf721c030c56', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-020-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-020', 1, 'わかりました、まず右上の古い番号を消します。', '[{"start":14,"end":16,"answer":"ばんごう","accept":["番号"]},{"start":17,"end":21,"answer":"けします","accept":["消します"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-020-d1.mp3', 'fd9a6eb8b5157ad815d5d1dc3101d842a9518469d1e4095ce5a0385c6fdb1d1d', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-021-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-021', 1, 'では、青い袋をいただきます。', '[{"start":3,"end":5,"answer":"あおい","accept":["青い","あおい"]},{"start":5,"end":6,"answer":"ふくろ","accept":["袋","ふくろ"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-021-d1.mp3', 'bdfe58fc92ae38dfd671246629e24f11bef8b0ff06a88f9155e71425a337235b', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-022-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-022', 1, 'わかりました、写真と成績の紙は入れないで、郵便で出します。', '[{"start":7,"end":9,"answer":"しゃしん","accept":["写真","しゃしん"]},{"start":10,"end":12,"answer":"せいせき","accept":["成績","せいせき"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-022-d1.mp3', '4907f211d9dcaece59b9aa10e88c848c5ecb8e7a87017c420bdb18bd0053e6fd', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-023-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-023', 1, 'はい、かばんから出して、色で分けます。', '[{"start":8,"end":11,"answer":"だして","accept":["出して"]},{"start":12,"end":13,"answer":"いろ","accept":["色"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-023-d1.mp3', 'd6b3bc518ef4fe061d7ef2ebe89fb7be564b8e68311006c015cf77829f82db9e', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-024-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-024', 1, 'では、一万円の山のほうをお願いします。', '[{"start":7,"end":8,"answer":"やま","accept":["山"]},{"start":12,"end":18,"answer":"おねがいします","accept":["お願いします","おねがいします"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-024-d1.mp3', '2fc1dc88d553192b8dac641c1e5a6bcf1f84bd11a2e2ec23fee47bff17879e9f', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-025-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-025', 1, 'では、牛乳の箱二つとはさみですね。', '[{"start":3,"end":5,"answer":"ぎゅうにゅう","accept":["牛乳","ぎゅうにゅう"]},{"start":10,"end":13,"answer":"はさみ","accept":["はさみ"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-025-d1.mp3', '80e707db49920e5153114cd0b9b1c0a6cfa19f6b47eb0090516d8974d7d7782f', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-026-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-026', 1, 'わかりました、先に今の資料を送ります。', '[{"start":11,"end":13,"answer":"しりょう","accept":["資料","しりょう"]},{"start":14,"end":18,"answer":"おくります","accept":["送ります"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-026-d1.mp3', 'a6f14e0b50face222a8b09eff9e62b915ab6851f39388a6d11120fd689734b4d', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-027-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-027', 1, 'お茶をお願いします。', '[{"start":0,"end":2,"answer":"おちゃ","accept":["お茶","おちゃ"]},{"start":3,"end":9,"answer":"おねがいします","accept":["お願いします","おねがいします"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-027-d1.mp3', 'e53fc50e9e94a00f01973662b014e4785e2ae64d8fbba7a0c8fe9c4962112149', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-028-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-028', 1, 'では、川の右のほうへ行って、道路の手前を左に曲がるんですね。', '[{"start":14,"end":16,"answer":"どうろ","accept":["道路"]},{"start":22,"end":25,"answer":"まがる","accept":["曲がる","まがる"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-028-d1.mp3', 'cf60391cd81f475297d409569e82e3a3bbf7da2dd8eb00678a6e7ad449f4ee6b', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-029-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-029', 1, 'わかりました、辞書と携帯はかばんで、学生証も出すんですね。', '[{"start":7,"end":9,"answer":"じしょ","accept":["辞書","じしょ"]},{"start":10,"end":12,"answer":"けいたい","accept":["携帯","けいたい"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-029-d1.mp3', 'ada20f57ec08e46432c79e23d9b056f3eaa93d7eb4d82294d15ce1ffd03c2b58', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-030-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-030', 1, 'では、今から先生の部屋へ行きます。', '[{"start":6,"end":8,"answer":"せんせい","accept":["先生"]},{"start":12,"end":16,"answer":"いきます","accept":["行きます"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-030-d1.mp3', '48dd929f754496876ddd5e7dad3f5b51ac244abdebc0711b5a0f405b8e1e089f', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-031-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-031', 1, 'まず、それをかけてみます。合わなかったら、仕事のあとで店へ行きます。', '[{"start":21,"end":23,"answer":"しごと","accept":["仕事","しごと"]},{"start":29,"end":33,"answer":"いきます","accept":["行きます"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-031-d1.mp3', 'f8a05268546e176a49c44eb0a05ef71d840b1d9300ed0cc31dd2b0165227bdde', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-032-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-032', 1, 'それは家で使います。小さい青いタオルを持って行ってください。', '[{"start":5,"end":9,"answer":"つかいます","accept":["使います"]},{"start":10,"end":13,"answer":"ちいさい","accept":["小さい"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-032-d1.mp3', 'd8cd52f5cab7d5466f74e30e0e54ee93f3c5280dba88cdaf835b72fb0b8829f9', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-033-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-033', 1, 'わかりました。小さい青い箱を開けて、本を出します。', '[{"start":7,"end":10,"answer":"ちいさい","accept":["小さい"]},{"start":10,"end":12,"answer":"あおい","accept":["青い","あおい"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-033-d1.mp3', 'f1f83a87d84659675a9e95fcf1ff9a24aff14865d6f852400aa905e70a2e6d72', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-034-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-034', 1, 'では、まず弟の家へ行きます。そのあと母の家ですね。', '[{"start":5,"end":6,"answer":"おとうと","accept":["弟","おとうと"]},{"start":9,"end":13,"answer":"いきます","accept":["行きます"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-034-d1.mp3', '6e77d7396b8da08f4a46148145e01f29cb39045069f09b07ac1bca16927bc6a3', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-035-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-035', 1, 'では、赤いのを一つと青いのを二つください。', '[{"start":3,"end":5,"answer":"あかい","accept":["赤い","あかい"]},{"start":7,"end":9,"answer":"ひとつ","accept":["一つ"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-035-d1.mp3', '784b5d0e2ad6bd42a862bf13ebc630163e2ab80e0d5b6da454dcfb793a1648fa', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-036-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-036', 1, 'わかりました。名前のある白い紙を出します。', '[{"start":7,"end":9,"answer":"なまえ","accept":["名前"]},{"start":12,"end":14,"answer":"しろい","accept":["白い","しろい"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-036-d1.mp3', 'd0efc1c830d59d62f4272dc6edd679b3649b8313d7f4c71e088fec05248c6f1f', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-037-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-037', 1, 'では、白いふくろのパンを先に食べます。スープはあとで。', '[{"start":14,"end":18,"answer":"たべます","accept":["食べます"]},{"start":19,"end":22,"answer":"スープ","accept":["スープ"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-037-d1.mp3', 'edf919ae9d9e715768cae621a984f91162e21bb87d2d13be1fcbf79cae8fe107', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-038-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-038', 1, 'そうですね。七時に出ます。朝ごはんは六時半に食べます。', '[{"start":9,"end":12,"answer":"でます","accept":["出ます"]},{"start":22,"end":26,"answer":"たべます","accept":["食べます"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-038-d1.mp3', 'fc243562df21145e791dd3044390cb68e82e751832d4e12af0ad4003d0cce7c8', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-039-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-039', 1, 'そうですね。庭の写真を使います。小さいですが、顔がよく見えます。', '[{"start":11,"end":15,"answer":"つかいます","accept":["使います"]},{"start":27,"end":31,"answer":"みえます","accept":["見えます"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-039-d1.mp3', 'f477ad6ad5f515231313b1f3fcad0e42bdc9c23824c547ebee039c9ca879e398', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-040-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-040', 1, 'では、小さい青いいすを二つ運びます。', '[{"start":3,"end":6,"answer":"ちいさい","accept":["小さい"]},{"start":6,"end":8,"answer":"あおい","accept":["青い","あおい"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-040-d1.mp3', 'f75bf356e96459447e5be4950d04c2e4f2c84fff7e237c0dec22ab5049d4bd3d', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-041-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-041', 1, 'わかりました。まずはいて、少し歩いてみます。', '[{"start":13,"end":15,"answer":"すこし","accept":["少し"]},{"start":15,"end":18,"answer":"あるいて","accept":["歩いて"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-041-d1.mp3', '16efcbccd17fb586929d4e4d6d273b5a0f078fb413324bc4917ed7c3bbfe97a6', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-042-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-042', 1, '海は日が強いですから、ぼうしを持って来てください。', '[{"start":4,"end":6,"answer":"つよい","accept":["強い","つよい"]},{"start":15,"end":18,"answer":"もって","accept":["持って"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-042-d1.mp3', '7140af4b8b98ed5991bf72072962270623815e4a577d2febfb9994f15f41bf08', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-043-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-043', 1, '小さいのは見にくいので、大きい青いのをかけます。', '[{"start":0,"end":3,"answer":"ちいさい","accept":["小さい"]},{"start":12,"end":15,"answer":"おおきい","accept":["大きい"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-043-d1.mp3', 'dfd4a2e9b1b1a2b04738eb3179552eb2db23cdf772cf70617a9b4a25ed231784', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-044-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-044', 1, 'そうですね。まずホテルに電話します。バスはそのあとで調べます。', '[{"start":8,"end":11,"answer":"ホテル","accept":["ホテル"]},{"start":26,"end":30,"answer":"しらべます","accept":["調べます"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-044-d1.mp3', 'be5ab144c291d161f900e5fe12a6360af528362f2dedd69561ea3b2a4f2f2080', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-045-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-045', 1, 'では、右の名前を消して、左に書きます。', '[{"start":5,"end":7,"answer":"なまえ","accept":["名前"]},{"start":14,"end":18,"answer":"かきます","accept":["書きます"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-045-d1.mp3', '39c806dd5e26d39f3bf372818c485fded5fb6ab7484f49c0253e2a8ac72fca25', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-046-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-046', 1, 'では、外のラジオを入れます。水がかかるとこまりますから。', '[{"start":5,"end":8,"answer":"ラジオ","accept":["ラジオ"]},{"start":9,"end":13,"answer":"はいれます","accept":["入れます"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-046-d1.mp3', '6dbbf03e46205467b035dbbb8be38eccc10d3d4451c6ea7e545c91b1a0047f39', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-047-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-047', 1, '今日の時間を知らないといけませんから、まず赤い手紙を読みます。', '[{"start":0,"end":2,"answer":"きょう","accept":["今日","きょう"]},{"start":26,"end":30,"answer":"よみます","accept":["読みます"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-047-d1.mp3', '328ebef0d370dc54a15735e7ca1834ef56a5d5df6fbb729f9e48fbcbb490ea8a', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-048-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-048', 1, 'わかりました。左の赤いエレベーターですね。', '[{"start":9,"end":11,"answer":"あかい","accept":["赤い","あかい"]},{"start":11,"end":17,"answer":"エレベーター","accept":["エレベーター"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-048-d1.mp3', 'ee17b20cd0c665f8cd7ecb9b284acbcd344953fac589d006e8878e98fc9ba6d9', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-049-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-049', 1, '八時は遅いです。七時の大人のチケットを一枚ください。', '[{"start":3,"end":5,"answer":"おそい","accept":["遅い","おそい"]},{"start":14,"end":18,"answer":"チケット","accept":["チケット"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-049-d1.mp3', '75af361d78e24fda538653e28c304fac4e8bdc8f4fa050d4b5c714070de71b41', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-050-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-050', 1, 'わかりました。スープを出してから、なべを洗います。', '[{"start":7,"end":10,"answer":"スープ","accept":["スープ"]},{"start":11,"end":14,"answer":"だして","accept":["出して"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-050-d1.mp3', '98449cfed15e39331df1a1d2bd848b9e626d3a74c997b117eb673a9003c340f5', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-051-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-051', 1, 'わかりました。薄い上着をかばんに入れます。', '[{"start":7,"end":9,"answer":"うすい","accept":["薄い"]},{"start":16,"end":20,"answer":"はいれます","accept":["入れます"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-051-d1.mp3', 'b0d0b142d3f550481aea0865bcab706bb202caace5f9a5d226fb6ba8e2a7ab65', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-052-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-052', 1, 'では、まず本屋に行きます。映画館へはそのあとで。', '[{"start":8,"end":12,"answer":"いきます","accept":["行きます"]},{"start":13,"end":16,"answer":"えいがかん","accept":["映画館","えいがかん"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-052-d1.mp3', '9b6a3b6ebf706763cd5b3559048078c3a9087aff82d034294f7f039ac684b725', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
('N4-L-TASK-053-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-053', 1, 'では、短い黒いスカートをください。', '[{"start":3,"end":5,"answer":"みじかい","accept":["短い","みじかい"]},{"start":7,"end":11,"answer":"スカート","accept":["スカート"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-053-d1.mp3', 'f01448af88b3a8a8d561f53164d88aced5e23b915e6fd3a98f306c9ab8644140', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
