('N4-L-TASK-062-D1', 'N4-L-TASK-062', 1, '先にバスでちゅうおう駅へ行きます。', '[{"start":0,"end":2,"answer":"さきに","accept":["先に"]},{"start":12,"end":16,"answer":"いきます","accept":["行きます"]}]', 'learning-path/N4/skills/N4-L-TASK-062-d1.mp3', '246f21f8838f1ac31e6fd8ef0a75d5311381e717797711ba5b89adf0fc7e78ac', 'AI_CHECKED', 1, '74dc4310fe3f'),
